WEBVTT

00:40.290 --> 00:45.003
ALCHEMY OF SOULS
PART 2

00:45.712 --> 00:46.546
Please tell me.

00:48.048 --> 00:49.215
What do I have inside my body?

00:50.675 --> 00:51.634
I'd like to know…

00:54.137 --> 00:55.180
before I die soon.

01:01.519 --> 01:03.980
When I fell unconscious
after having been seriously injured,

01:04.731 --> 01:07.150
they told me that
you gave me some of your blood.

01:09.903 --> 01:10.779
Didn't you?

01:12.030 --> 01:13.198
I only did it to save you.

01:13.782 --> 01:16.367
Because I thought the energy of
the blood parasite would keep you alive.

01:16.951 --> 01:17.827
Parasite?

01:22.624 --> 01:25.293
So inside me… was a parasite.

01:25.376 --> 01:27.420
They told me that
you'd be fine with the medicine.

01:27.504 --> 01:28.838
That's why I've been sending it to you.

01:29.589 --> 01:30.799
You never took them?

01:35.428 --> 01:36.262
Why?

01:39.933 --> 01:41.392
It's because you could not trust…

01:43.103 --> 01:45.313
something that came from a girl like me…

01:47.107 --> 01:47.941
Young Master?

01:58.660 --> 01:59.702
Put it back in me.

02:00.829 --> 02:02.789
Put that parasite inside you
back in me right now.

02:05.708 --> 02:07.252
- I said put it in me--
- Stop moving!

02:07.919 --> 02:08.753
This cut is deep.

02:13.091 --> 02:14.384
You are so reckless.

02:20.557 --> 02:22.934
Even someone like myself
was able to cut it out.

02:24.185 --> 02:25.728
So how come you can't remove it?

02:25.812 --> 02:28.148
The moment it entered
my energy-filled body,

02:29.941 --> 02:31.151
it entered the core of my energy.

02:32.402 --> 02:33.736
The parasite has settled there

02:33.820 --> 02:36.156
and it's currently eating away
every bit of my energy.

02:39.200 --> 02:40.827
I will die the moment
that it's all been consumed.

02:42.162 --> 02:43.872
I'm sure there must be a way.

02:43.955 --> 02:46.416
Jin U-tak was the one
who put that parasite inside of me,

02:46.499 --> 02:48.001
so it must be a Jinyowon relic.

02:48.626 --> 02:50.753
There must be a way
to get rid of it there.

02:53.464 --> 02:57.260
Was the one who gave you the medicine
Gwanju Jin Mu of Cheonbugwan?

03:03.808 --> 03:06.102
Then he must have told you
to spread rumors about…

03:07.687 --> 03:08.855
how Naksu's come back to life.

03:12.442 --> 03:14.777
Does he also know
that the blood parasite is now in my body?

03:17.822 --> 03:18.781
No one else knows.

03:23.411 --> 03:25.121
There's no need to send medicine anymore.

03:25.705 --> 03:27.081
Nor will I come see you again.

03:30.043 --> 03:32.212
I came here
for the last time to sort things out.

03:33.087 --> 03:34.964
Please continue to keep this a secret.

03:43.139 --> 03:44.599
You're about to die all because of me

03:45.225 --> 03:46.476
so why are you letting me go?

03:47.769 --> 03:49.395
Shouldn't you want to kill me?

03:54.609 --> 03:56.361
I believe that
you only did this to save me.

03:57.528 --> 03:58.363
Am I right?

04:09.624 --> 04:11.751
Maidservant Kim gave this to me.

04:11.834 --> 04:14.420
These diamonds are
very rare and precious, aren't they?

04:15.797 --> 04:17.215
Are you giving them back to me then?

04:19.175 --> 04:21.511
- Take them, please.
- I knew you'd reject me.

04:23.263 --> 04:24.097
I understand.

04:29.811 --> 04:31.521
Why are you trembling like that?

04:36.109 --> 04:37.277
For the past three years…

04:40.238 --> 04:41.948
I've been dreading that a moment…

04:43.199 --> 04:44.242
like this would come.

04:46.619 --> 04:49.247
I would tear up just thinking about it.

04:51.582 --> 04:52.667
Now that it's here…

04:55.044 --> 04:57.005
it's simply unbearable.

04:58.006 --> 04:59.382
So that was the thought

05:00.216 --> 05:02.510
that's been on your mind
for these past years.

05:08.474 --> 05:09.809
Then see for yourself

05:10.560 --> 05:12.228
what these three years were like for me.

05:22.155 --> 05:22.989
This is…

05:24.324 --> 05:26.451
the charm that brings lovers together.

05:27.994 --> 05:29.954
Have you kept it this entire time though?

05:31.456 --> 05:33.416
Not even for a second did I believe you

05:34.125 --> 05:36.044
would simply forget
what I've meant to you…

05:38.629 --> 05:40.048
unless I abandoned you.

05:41.674 --> 05:42.508
So then…

05:43.634 --> 05:46.179
is the reason you're showing me this…

05:49.098 --> 05:51.559
to let me know that
you actually didn't throw it away…

05:52.769 --> 05:54.062
and kept it all this time?

05:54.145 --> 05:55.980
Otherwise, I would have tossed it.

05:56.731 --> 05:58.066
Why else would I show it to you?

05:58.649 --> 05:59.567
Oh.

06:02.195 --> 06:03.029
Thank you for this.

06:05.198 --> 06:07.533
Just knowing you didn't throw it away…

06:09.160 --> 06:10.203
gives me some relief.

06:11.329 --> 06:13.539
I'm thankful
for the present that you sent.

06:18.086 --> 06:20.630
But right now, I don't think
I can wear it in public yet.

06:22.840 --> 06:23.758
That's more than fine.

06:24.842 --> 06:26.344
But you should still hold on to it.

06:26.427 --> 06:28.179
It is a present after all.

06:30.556 --> 06:33.601
It'd be a waste to… just to keep it.

06:33.684 --> 06:37.105
Uh, so how about you wear it
at least for a moment then?

06:59.460 --> 07:00.294
How is it?

07:01.504 --> 07:02.547
Do I look pretty?

07:07.009 --> 07:08.010
Yeah.

07:10.847 --> 07:12.932
You're absolutely
the most beautiful woman…

07:14.684 --> 07:15.726
in the world.

07:30.491 --> 07:32.785
Thank you for this, for your help now.

07:32.869 --> 07:35.163
I also was hoping that this would make

07:35.246 --> 07:38.124
people stop talking
about that woman Naksu.

07:38.207 --> 07:43.629
With this, Uk has finally erased Naksu
from this world once and for all.

07:43.713 --> 07:47.383
I only hope he's erased her
from his heart as well.

07:48.968 --> 07:51.804
Naksu was Jang Uk's true love.
Everyone knows that.

07:51.888 --> 07:56.559
I understand why you are not happy
to welcome Uk as your son-in-law.

07:58.186 --> 08:00.771
Why would that insufferable man
want to take Bu-yeon?

08:00.855 --> 08:04.692
I understand that Bu-yeon needed him
to escape being Jinyowon's heir.

08:04.775 --> 08:08.154
What I don't get is why
he wanted to marry her in the first place.

08:08.237 --> 08:11.991
Bu-yeon is a priestess
with the power to see energy.

08:12.575 --> 08:15.953
I heard that she recognized
with just a single glance at him…

08:17.288 --> 08:20.249
the ice stone
and the energy of the sky within it.

08:21.292 --> 08:23.878
The energy of… the sky?

08:25.296 --> 08:27.131
She said that
it was her job to protect him.

08:29.342 --> 08:32.053
I hope they'll be able

08:33.179 --> 08:35.598
to keep each other out of harm's way.

09:43.874 --> 09:45.543
I guess you are still dreaming.

09:48.212 --> 09:49.130
That's a shame.

10:04.186 --> 10:05.646
I'm not dreaming anymore.

10:07.231 --> 10:08.065
So…

10:09.984 --> 10:11.152
do you know who I am then?

10:11.235 --> 10:12.361
Yeah.

10:13.404 --> 10:14.363
You're the one who woke me up.

10:23.831 --> 10:25.333
I didn't mean to wake you.

10:25.416 --> 10:27.501
You got drunk
and mistook me for someone else.

10:27.585 --> 10:30.463
The only reason I stayed was
because I couldn't leave you like that.

10:31.088 --> 10:33.257
I thought you were still asleep though.

10:33.341 --> 10:35.343
Then let's just pretend
I never woke up and…

10:36.093 --> 10:37.345
leave so I can go back to bed.

10:37.428 --> 10:38.804
That's the best I've slept…

10:40.222 --> 10:41.599
in what seems like forever, you know.

10:45.436 --> 10:46.937
Actually, I'm the one
you should thank for that.

10:47.021 --> 10:49.106
You are the one
who woke me up from my deep sleep.

10:51.692 --> 10:53.361
Can't you feel
how the energy's changed in here?

10:53.444 --> 10:55.863
The wraiths have all
fled this place because I'm here.

10:55.946 --> 10:57.740
See? It's not cold anymore.

11:04.830 --> 11:06.123
So if I leave,

11:06.916 --> 11:08.626
I doubt you'll be able
to sleep like you were.

11:12.296 --> 11:13.547
- Should I…
- Okay then…

11:15.675 --> 11:16.717
stay here.

11:19.679 --> 11:21.681
I mean both you and I are
in need of some rest.

11:23.140 --> 11:26.102
So sleep here
and try not to wake me again.

11:30.648 --> 11:31.482
Fine.

11:32.233 --> 11:33.067
I guess so.

11:34.902 --> 11:38.739
Since helping you sleep better
is a way you can use me.

11:50.084 --> 11:52.044
I heard it's hard for you to sleep
because of the ice stone.

11:54.296 --> 11:55.798
Isn't that why you brought me here?

11:56.757 --> 11:57.800
To help you sleep?

11:59.510 --> 12:00.344
Yeah.

12:01.929 --> 12:03.097
That's why I brought you here.

12:04.515 --> 12:06.016
So I can fall into a deep sleep.

12:11.439 --> 12:13.691
Uk, has falling asleep been…

12:14.775 --> 12:16.318
truly that difficult for you?

12:19.739 --> 12:21.115
I'm sorry I woke you up.

12:24.076 --> 12:26.203
Should I pat your back again
so you can sleep?

12:30.624 --> 12:31.459
Wh-What?

12:31.542 --> 12:34.295
One of the reasons you slept so well
was because I patted you.

12:34.837 --> 12:36.714
I did it until my wrist hurt, you know.

12:37.965 --> 12:38.883
Should I do it?

12:38.966 --> 12:41.385
It's fine. You…

12:43.804 --> 12:45.765
This here… Don't cross this line.

13:23.677 --> 13:24.887
See, it's warm.

13:26.806 --> 13:27.640
Yeah.

13:30.267 --> 13:31.227
It is warm.

14:04.510 --> 14:07.429
For letting Jang Uk stay
in Jeongjingak with the ice stone,

14:07.513 --> 14:12.059
the pupils from the other mage families
have all decided to leave this place.

14:12.142 --> 14:15.437
My former master, Master Seo Gyeong,
established Jeongjingak

14:15.521 --> 14:17.273
and now it lies empty.

14:17.356 --> 14:21.569
Master, they're… they're all envious
because Songrim now has the ice stone

14:21.652 --> 14:22.903
so they are trying to exclude us.

14:22.987 --> 14:27.408
Having Jang Uk with us means
our power hasn't diminished one bit.

14:27.491 --> 14:30.619
Even though it's been three years,
I see you haven't matured one bit, Yeom.

14:30.703 --> 14:31.996
- Hmm?
- Master Seo Gyeong

14:32.079 --> 14:35.499
didn't build Jeongjingak hoping to see
which mage was the strongest,

14:35.583 --> 14:37.585
but rather to unify and educate the world.

14:37.668 --> 14:39.420
- Yes.
- I apologize, Master Lee.

14:39.503 --> 14:42.506
I have failed to honor his late wishes.

14:43.048 --> 14:44.633
Jin, you tried your best.

14:45.384 --> 14:47.303
You put your life
on the line to protect Jang Uk

14:47.386 --> 14:50.097
and pacified the complaints
from all the other mages.

14:50.764 --> 14:53.017
You even retired at such a young age.

14:55.811 --> 14:58.939
You always favor Jin over me, Master.

15:02.610 --> 15:07.197
I heard that you had treated
Jin Bu-yeon when she was very ill.

15:07.281 --> 15:09.533
Mm, remember what she said?

15:09.617 --> 15:13.287
She was treated by the one
who is the best physician in Daeho.

15:13.370 --> 15:17.875
And that physician was our dear master.

15:17.958 --> 15:21.587
Lady Jin had begged me to keep
her daughter's treatment a secret.

15:21.670 --> 15:24.298
Now that she's married to Jang Uk
and is revealed to the world,

15:24.381 --> 15:25.799
there's nothing to hide.

15:25.883 --> 15:28.469
Uk, that rascal,
he must have also been the one

15:28.552 --> 15:30.346
who kidnapped her on her wedding day.

15:30.429 --> 15:33.432
Right? He just declared
they were married like that.

15:33.515 --> 15:35.851
He threw
the Unanimous Assembly into chaos.

15:41.774 --> 15:43.442
So I guess this is fate then.

15:44.902 --> 15:45.736
Something…

15:46.695 --> 15:48.155
humans cannot control.

15:57.164 --> 15:58.040
It is warm.

15:58.832 --> 16:00.000
Please keep going.

16:22.398 --> 16:23.399
What was that?

16:23.983 --> 16:25.401
That didn't happen last night.

16:32.032 --> 16:33.951
Was that another one
of her memories as well?

16:46.380 --> 16:47.214
Master,

16:47.840 --> 16:48.966
I finally did it.

16:49.049 --> 16:50.884
I missed you too. That's my response.

16:50.968 --> 16:52.428
Try to look pretty for your Young Master?

17:03.188 --> 17:04.481
Young Master.

17:05.524 --> 17:06.358
Young Master.

17:06.984 --> 17:08.110
Young Master.

17:09.278 --> 17:10.320
Young Master.

17:24.084 --> 17:25.794
The soul shifter you killed yesterday

17:26.462 --> 17:27.463
wasn't Naksu, was it?

17:27.546 --> 17:30.049
The rumor that's been
going around everywhere made it seem true.

17:30.132 --> 17:31.633
So now, that name won't be a problem.

17:32.968 --> 17:34.011
It will not appear ever again.

17:34.094 --> 17:36.013
Jin Mu was the one who spread that rumor.

17:37.681 --> 17:38.682
I know.

17:42.144 --> 17:43.353
So you had already suspected him.

17:48.067 --> 17:49.151
Due to this incident,

17:50.069 --> 17:52.112
this is the first time
we've actually talked about her.

17:59.453 --> 18:00.287
Uk, she…

18:02.790 --> 18:04.416
she sometimes comes to me in my dreams.

18:09.004 --> 18:11.757
Some nights, though, I have dreams
that she stabs me with a sword.

18:12.549 --> 18:13.550
And other nights…

18:16.512 --> 18:18.138
I dream I'm the one who stabs her.

18:21.350 --> 18:23.393
I believe it has to be
due to the guilt I feel

18:24.812 --> 18:26.396
for running away like I did.

18:32.736 --> 18:34.321
She's just as rude as she was alive!

18:34.863 --> 18:36.782
Why would she torment you
in your dreams when…

18:37.699 --> 18:38.784
you did nothing wrong?

18:44.123 --> 18:44.957
Yul.

18:46.500 --> 18:48.794
From the moment
I first saw those eyes of hers,

18:49.795 --> 18:51.004
it was my responsibility.

18:51.088 --> 18:52.256
So you…

18:53.382 --> 18:54.883
shouldn't feel so guilty about it.

18:55.884 --> 18:56.927
It's not like you ran away.

18:58.929 --> 19:00.514
I appreciate you saying that.

19:02.307 --> 19:04.268
If only I'd recognized her before you did,

19:05.519 --> 19:07.437
I would've also taken
responsibility for everything.

19:09.356 --> 19:12.025
Hey, Uk, Yul, come and eat.

19:12.109 --> 19:14.361
So you can be responsible
for eating the breakfast.

19:14.444 --> 19:17.739
I had to eat 100 of his dumplings
and there's still about 50 left.

19:18.282 --> 19:19.283
So good luck!

19:19.992 --> 19:21.827
What? Just eat ten of them.

19:25.205 --> 19:27.124
You're on your own. It's up to you.

19:28.125 --> 19:30.085
- I have somewhere to go now.
- Go where?

19:30.169 --> 19:31.170
The palace.

19:32.045 --> 19:33.422
The people who spread that rumor…

19:34.381 --> 19:35.757
should take responsibility as well.

19:40.470 --> 19:41.805
Did you search everywhere?

19:42.848 --> 19:44.141
Then where could she be?

19:45.184 --> 19:47.144
Come on, let's go search
every inch of this place again.

19:47.227 --> 19:48.604
- Right, sir.
- Come on.

19:52.065 --> 19:54.151
- What's going on?
- Young Lady Bu-yeon is gone.

19:55.068 --> 19:57.571
Her head hurt
so I thought she was resting.

19:58.155 --> 19:59.239
But I can't find her though.

20:00.324 --> 20:01.992
- She was feeling ill?
- Yeah.

20:02.075 --> 20:05.412
Strangely enough, everyone says
they slept very well last night

20:05.495 --> 20:06.914
because the house felt warm.

20:06.997 --> 20:08.457
But somehow she didn't.

20:11.335 --> 20:13.503
The wraiths have all fled
this place because I'm here.

20:14.087 --> 20:16.006
See? It's not cold anymore.

20:17.382 --> 20:19.843
Bu-yeon drove the wraiths away.

20:21.470 --> 20:23.013
Did she really do so?

20:23.096 --> 20:23.972
Yeah.

20:24.765 --> 20:29.186
Ah, so that means
she took in all that cold energy?

20:30.062 --> 20:31.230
Maybe that's why.

20:31.897 --> 20:33.523
But where would she go if she was sick?

20:33.607 --> 20:35.025
Do you know where she would go?

20:35.108 --> 20:36.401
How would I know about that?

20:36.485 --> 20:38.904
Really? So you have no idea then?

20:38.987 --> 20:41.406
- I don't.
- Well, makes sense.

20:42.032 --> 20:45.327
I've never seen the pair of you
eat or even go out together.

20:45.911 --> 20:47.788
How would an absent husband know that?

20:48.413 --> 20:49.248
Forget it then.

20:50.082 --> 20:51.458
She's not here.

20:55.462 --> 20:56.463
She's feeling ill?

20:59.258 --> 21:00.509
Did only I sleep well?

21:15.899 --> 21:16.942
That bastard!

21:17.025 --> 21:19.111
Argh! That jerkface!

21:21.321 --> 21:22.489
Where could she have gone though?

21:32.416 --> 21:34.126
I don't really know anything about her…

21:35.460 --> 21:36.878
so I don't even know where to start.

21:40.215 --> 21:41.675
Should I try Jinyowon?

21:49.808 --> 21:51.143
Gosh, back so soon?

21:52.269 --> 21:54.855
I'll have the usual
and some honey biscuits too.

21:54.938 --> 21:55.939
Of course.

22:04.197 --> 22:06.616
Goodness, aren't you a beautiful girl!

22:06.700 --> 22:08.952
We have so many pretty choices.
Please take a look.

22:14.333 --> 22:15.375
How much is this one?

22:15.459 --> 22:16.960
It's only five nyang.

22:18.128 --> 22:19.087
That's too much!

22:19.171 --> 22:22.174
What? No, it's not.
I'm practically giving it away to you.

22:22.758 --> 22:23.842
Three nyang. Nothing less.

22:23.925 --> 22:25.093
- Three nyang?
- Mm.

22:25.177 --> 22:26.678
But you're robbing me blind.

22:26.762 --> 22:27.596
Three nyang?

22:27.679 --> 22:28.722
- Yeah.
- Okay.

22:30.807 --> 22:31.683
Oh, you bastard…

22:31.767 --> 22:33.935
Oh, gosh, looks like
those two are fighting again.

22:34.019 --> 22:35.479
- Anyway, here you are.
- Thank you, Miss.

22:35.562 --> 22:36.813
Who were you with last night, huh?

22:36.897 --> 22:39.232
What were you doing? You were not here!

22:39.316 --> 22:42.110
I fell asleep. You know I was drunk.

22:42.194 --> 22:43.487
Who do you take me for?

22:43.570 --> 22:46.114
You were with those widows,
weren't you? Why, you bastard!

22:46.198 --> 22:48.283
- Let go of me! Just let go!
- I wish you'd die!

22:48.367 --> 22:50.035
You're such a scumbag!

22:50.118 --> 22:51.119
What's going on here?

22:51.203 --> 22:53.372
She says her husband never sleeps at home.

22:53.455 --> 22:55.207
That's not what happened!
You got it all wrong!

22:55.290 --> 22:56.833
Oh, the wife must be very upset then.

22:56.917 --> 23:00.337
- I'm telling you that's not…
- Rumor is he's seeing a widow.

23:00.420 --> 23:02.464
You've been running around?
Stop trying to run away!

23:02.547 --> 23:03.632
Tell me the truth.

23:04.633 --> 23:07.302
- Who were you with last night?
- Come on, woman! Let go!

23:11.556 --> 23:12.641
Jang Uk.

23:13.934 --> 23:17.145
Apparently, that man was having an affair
with the woman at the oil shop.

23:17.729 --> 23:19.314
That's why he never returned home.

23:19.815 --> 23:21.191
Her husband's problematic, huh?

23:23.360 --> 23:26.488
Are you comparing me
to the man from the rice store?

23:26.571 --> 23:29.116
I did feel satisfied
watching that man getting his hair pulled.

23:31.243 --> 23:33.328
But why are you here now?

23:33.412 --> 23:35.872
I heard you're sick,
but you seem all right.

23:35.956 --> 23:37.374
Fine enough to pull my hair right now.

23:37.958 --> 23:40.168
You were looking for me
because you were worried?

23:42.003 --> 23:44.005
I came to find you
because no one knew where you were.

23:44.631 --> 23:46.716
I need you now. We have somewhere to be.

23:47.300 --> 23:48.260
I knew it.

23:48.927 --> 23:50.053
Where do we have to go?

23:57.310 --> 24:00.188
I heard that your head hurt.
But you're neither hot nor cold.

24:00.981 --> 24:01.815
Oh.

24:02.649 --> 24:05.026
I was a bit dizzy.

24:06.236 --> 24:08.405
I thought it'd get worse
if I stayed in the house.

24:08.488 --> 24:09.906
Say something if you're sick.

24:10.490 --> 24:11.533
We were worried about you.

24:11.616 --> 24:13.618
I know everyone over at the house

24:13.702 --> 24:16.079
would have been more than happy
to take care of you if you needed it.

24:19.666 --> 24:20.500
You too?

24:23.462 --> 24:24.588
I'm here, aren't I?

24:30.135 --> 24:31.928
Let's go. It's hot.

24:34.306 --> 24:35.765
Uk, doesn't that fan feel nice?

24:36.266 --> 24:37.851
I got a good deal on it.

24:37.934 --> 24:40.145
That woman ripped you off.
You paid double its worth.

24:40.228 --> 24:43.106
Really? She said
she was selling it for nothing.

24:43.732 --> 24:45.484
- Give it then.
- Hey, come on now.

24:46.109 --> 24:47.027
Sire.

24:47.819 --> 24:48.653
Come on in.

24:50.071 --> 24:53.200
This turtle, please leave it
at Chwiseonru for the next few days.

24:53.283 --> 24:55.494
The change in environment
might shock it, so be sure

24:55.577 --> 24:57.037
to move its entire enclosure there.

24:57.579 --> 24:59.498
And make sure they don't overfeed it.

24:59.581 --> 25:01.208
Got it? Ah!

25:01.750 --> 25:04.586
And don't tell them I sent the turtle,
just tell them that it comes from you.

25:04.669 --> 25:07.506
But why… why do you
bring them there so suddenly?

25:07.589 --> 25:10.217
I was thinking that I would show
some kindness to the poor Turtle Shaman

25:10.300 --> 25:12.052
who's lost her husband to a peacock.

25:12.844 --> 25:14.304
I'll do as you say, Your Highness.

25:14.846 --> 25:15.680
Oh, by the way,

25:16.264 --> 25:18.892
I heard that Jang Uk and Jin Bu-yeon
are at the palace right now.

25:19.518 --> 25:20.352
Why are they here?

25:20.435 --> 25:22.729
Apparently, they've come to apologize
for ruining the Queen's banquet

25:22.812 --> 25:24.940
- the other day.
- Jang Uk's here to apologize?

25:26.316 --> 25:28.318
- He can do that?
- Will you go and see them?

25:28.401 --> 25:30.445
Jin Bu-yeon was someone
I knew you wanted to meet.

25:30.529 --> 25:31.571
Forget it.

25:31.655 --> 25:33.573
Just go and get some people
to move the turtle.

25:34.449 --> 25:35.617
Yes, Your Highness.

25:39.621 --> 25:42.457
I'm the one who is responsible
for splitting Filthy Mu-deok and Jang Uk

25:42.541 --> 25:43.416
so he'd be alone.

25:45.835 --> 25:47.128
After doing what I'd done,

25:48.129 --> 25:50.382
I can't bear to see
Jin Bu-yeon in her place.

25:52.259 --> 25:53.426
If we're here to apologize,

25:53.510 --> 25:55.262
I can just get on my knees and beg, right?

25:55.845 --> 25:57.097
We're not here to apologize.

25:57.889 --> 25:59.933
- What?
- We're here to taunt them.

26:00.016 --> 26:02.018
They tried to take something
that was mine,

26:02.936 --> 26:04.771
so I've come here
to remind them that it's mine.

26:05.313 --> 26:06.147
What was it though?

26:11.111 --> 26:11.945
You.

26:17.867 --> 26:19.536
Don't you dare
get on your knees now and beg.

26:20.579 --> 26:24.082
Only keep your eyes on me
as if you're madly in love, okay?

26:31.590 --> 26:35.135
It was you two
who were in danger at my banquet.

26:35.969 --> 26:37.596
You don't need to apologize for that.

26:37.679 --> 26:40.348
No, my Queen.
I'm sorry that I brought Gwiseo.

26:40.432 --> 26:42.267
Especially when you haven't held
a banquet in years.

26:43.018 --> 26:44.144
But you see,

26:44.936 --> 26:47.230
this woman is so precious to me.
I had no choice

26:47.981 --> 26:49.649
other than replacing Bu-yeon with a relic

26:49.733 --> 26:52.360
out of fear that she could have
possibly been harmed at the banquet.

26:55.322 --> 26:57.782
I heard you two got married
without permission.

26:58.325 --> 27:00.118
But you two seem very in love.

27:01.036 --> 27:02.704
I feel that
she'll approve of us soon though.

27:03.330 --> 27:06.291
Could anyone else but myself
protect her daughter and Jinyowon?

27:06.374 --> 27:08.960
The way you speak is
as if Jinyowon is yours.

27:09.044 --> 27:10.337
It's because there are simply…

27:12.047 --> 27:14.049
too many who act as if
they have the power to take it.

27:15.842 --> 27:16.760
Jinyowon will…

27:17.719 --> 27:19.054
be protected as if it were mine.

27:24.225 --> 27:25.602
For this person right here.

27:29.731 --> 27:30.774
Bu-yeon, when I grab your hand,

27:31.358 --> 27:33.026
come up with a reasonable excuse to leave.

27:34.110 --> 27:35.570
- Just me?
- Yes.

27:35.654 --> 27:37.489
That's all that I need you to do in there.

27:38.114 --> 27:39.282
Remember what I said, okay?

27:40.241 --> 27:41.368
A reasonable excuse.

27:44.788 --> 27:46.081
It's a bee!

27:46.164 --> 27:48.333
I'm sorry. I'm just so terrified of bees.

27:53.421 --> 27:55.090
She's just so terrified of them

27:55.173 --> 27:57.175
since they always tend
to swarm her sweetness.

27:59.886 --> 28:02.430
I thought she was just
a confident girl when I first saw her.

28:03.139 --> 28:04.557
I guess she's rude too.

28:05.225 --> 28:07.102
That's part of her charm, isn't it?

28:07.185 --> 28:10.146
Always surpassing all expectations,
tends to keep me on my toes.

28:10.230 --> 28:13.066
You have gained a wife, Jinyowon,

28:13.149 --> 28:16.069
and even the power of the ice stone.
How greedy can you get?

28:16.152 --> 28:18.154
I'd love to use that power
in any way I please.

28:18.655 --> 28:21.741
But as you may know, I'm only
allowed to use it to catch soul shifters.

28:24.077 --> 28:25.203
It's such a shame!

28:25.870 --> 28:29.749
My powers would have been able to
make your deepest desires become reality.

28:31.710 --> 28:32.544
Right.

28:32.627 --> 28:36.589
With the power of Hwansu,
you could shift my soul with another.

28:38.717 --> 28:40.385
If you can help me with this,

28:40.468 --> 28:42.971
I would have no need to summon
another ice stone from the sky.

28:43.054 --> 28:46.391
How would you be able to
summon another ice stone though?

28:46.474 --> 28:48.810
I was told it's possible
by drying out the world.

28:48.893 --> 28:49.936
Ah.

28:51.020 --> 28:53.189
So the reason
you wanted to control Jinyowon

28:53.982 --> 28:56.109
was to find a relic to dry out the world.

28:56.192 --> 28:57.569
I finally understand it now.

28:58.153 --> 29:01.740
I knew you were trying to keep me occupied
by summoning Naksu to our world.

29:02.323 --> 29:04.951
What I could not understand is why

29:05.452 --> 29:07.746
you would go so far as to hurt
Jin Bu-yeon to take Jinyowon.

29:07.829 --> 29:08.663
Jang Uk.

29:10.498 --> 29:12.459
Shift my soul using your powers now.

29:13.293 --> 29:16.796
Do that, and I'll have no interest
in drying out this entire world.

29:21.092 --> 29:23.511
I, too, couldn't care less
if this world dries out.

29:23.595 --> 29:25.346
But if you ever touch Bu-yeon again,

29:25.972 --> 29:26.806
then you'll…

29:27.474 --> 29:29.976
see me use the power
that's inside me any way I want.

29:37.984 --> 29:39.903
Please relay this message with anyone else

29:40.862 --> 29:43.156
who's been scheming with you as well.

30:18.358 --> 30:20.693
And with this incident,
Jang Uk and I have become

30:20.777 --> 30:22.403
even clearer enemies to each other.

30:23.154 --> 30:27.450
Your Highness. Gwanju Jin Mu asked you
to come to Cheonbugwan as soon as you can.

30:27.534 --> 30:29.744
He's asking me to go there
instead of coming here

30:30.453 --> 30:31.579
in order to meet with me?

30:31.663 --> 30:34.374
He said it was regarding the promise
he made you the last time you met.

30:35.291 --> 30:39.796
The first thing I plan to do
is bring Jinyowon to the royal family.

30:40.421 --> 30:42.549
I'm doing all of this for you, Sire.

30:44.133 --> 30:46.469
I decided to keep Jin Mu
by my side to beat Jang Uk.

30:46.553 --> 30:49.472
But now somehow it seems that
I'm the one being used by Jin Mu.

30:56.020 --> 30:57.814
Are you heading to Cheonbugwan then?

30:57.897 --> 31:00.733
No. I would like to see Jang Uk's bride.

31:05.405 --> 31:07.782
It seems like
he was going to talk about Jinyowon.

31:08.449 --> 31:09.617
So why did he make me leave?

31:10.493 --> 31:11.411
Odd!

31:21.588 --> 31:23.590
Be careful with the turtle
so you don't startle it.

31:24.465 --> 31:25.800
Slowly, slowly.

31:28.845 --> 31:29.679
Pardon.

31:30.221 --> 31:33.349
Does that turtle belong to Eunuch Go
who works in the palace?

31:33.433 --> 31:35.268
It's the eunuch
who works for the Crown Prince.

31:35.351 --> 31:36.519
Ah!

31:37.228 --> 31:38.771
I don't think we have a Eunuch Go here.

31:38.855 --> 31:40.481
He must be Eunuch Oh then.

31:41.900 --> 31:44.110
- Ah, Eunuch Oh.
- Yeah.

31:44.193 --> 31:45.778
Then I must have heard him wrong.

31:46.654 --> 31:49.741
But we are moving the turtle
under Eunuch Oh's instructions.

31:50.325 --> 31:51.701
- You are?
- Yes.

31:55.580 --> 31:57.999
So that really is you.

31:58.082 --> 31:59.792
Your life sure is nice at the palace.

32:00.376 --> 32:02.670
Set it down for a moment.

32:03.546 --> 32:05.506
I just wanted to say hi since I know it.

32:05.590 --> 32:06.424
Sure.

32:07.467 --> 32:08.384
Oh, wow!

32:09.218 --> 32:10.261
Have you been doing well?

32:10.345 --> 32:12.722
It seems like it recognizes you.

32:23.024 --> 32:24.817
The water's clean but it's a bit cold.

32:25.985 --> 32:26.819
Are you okay?

32:46.214 --> 32:47.966
Gosh, that must
have been so tough for you.

32:50.051 --> 32:50.927
Your Highness.

32:56.432 --> 32:57.934
Did anyone change its water?

32:58.017 --> 32:59.936
Even a turtle could
get sick if it's too cold.

33:00.019 --> 33:02.772
Worry not, Young Master Jang Uk
also thought it was cold

33:02.855 --> 33:05.483
so he warmed it by using his energy, Sire.

33:06.067 --> 33:07.568
Jang Uk really took care of my turtle?

33:09.862 --> 33:11.322
- Did he know it was mine though?
- Yes.

33:11.406 --> 33:14.200
I told him Eunuch Oh
had ordered it to be moved.

33:15.034 --> 33:17.912
So he warmed the water with his energy
despite knowing it was my turtle.

33:17.996 --> 33:19.205
Sire.

33:19.288 --> 33:22.333
Jang Uk then must not
really feel that hostile towards you.

33:22.417 --> 33:26.170
Otherwise, why would he bother
to take care of your turtle at all?

33:26.254 --> 33:27.088
You're right.

33:28.339 --> 33:30.133
He would hate
my turtle as well if he hated me.

33:30.216 --> 33:32.051
- Where is Uk?
- Where is Uk?

33:32.135 --> 33:33.011
Where…

33:33.761 --> 33:36.723
Oh, uh, well, Jang Uk just
left here with his betrothed.

33:39.017 --> 33:41.686
Huh! Hmm, all right then. You may go now.

33:42.270 --> 33:43.104
Come on.

33:47.984 --> 33:49.444
Jang Uk took care of my turtle?

33:51.029 --> 33:53.573
So what am I supposed to make of all this?

33:54.949 --> 33:56.284
Huh…

33:57.201 --> 33:58.202
Huh?

34:03.708 --> 34:05.460
I'm certain he despises me.

34:06.586 --> 34:07.754
So why did he do that?

34:16.596 --> 34:19.057
I only did it because it was your turtle.

34:19.891 --> 34:20.725
Exactly.

34:21.976 --> 34:25.646
It's my turtle, but why would you
take care of it? Why?

34:25.730 --> 34:27.065
It's because that turtle was yours.

34:28.983 --> 34:30.026
But I thought you despise me.

34:30.109 --> 34:32.904
So why would you warm up
my turtle with your energy for no reason?

34:32.987 --> 34:34.197
Still not getting it?

34:35.448 --> 34:36.783
It's because that turtle was yours.

34:40.912 --> 34:41.746
Jang Uk.

34:43.039 --> 34:45.249
Tell me why on earth
did you take care of my turtle?

34:45.875 --> 34:46.918
If you do this…

34:48.544 --> 34:50.713
you're only giving me hope
that you don't actually hate me…

34:52.215 --> 34:53.424
as much as I thought.

34:56.928 --> 34:58.638
Thank you for helping take care of it.

34:59.388 --> 35:00.807
The eunuch sure will be pleased.

35:05.394 --> 35:07.396
So, when exactly
did you befriend a eunuch?

35:08.147 --> 35:09.273
We just met by chance.

35:09.357 --> 35:11.734
He's a kind man who saved
the turtle just because I asked him to.

35:11.818 --> 35:12.819
Oh.

35:13.653 --> 35:15.655
So you saved a turtle, made a friend,

35:15.738 --> 35:17.365
even watched a couple get into a fight.

35:18.241 --> 35:19.075
Sounds like fun.

35:20.243 --> 35:21.869
All thanks to my husband for saving me.

35:26.082 --> 35:26.916
Jang Uk.

35:31.295 --> 35:32.296
I heard that…

35:33.589 --> 35:34.924
you destroyed the tracking thread.

35:40.471 --> 35:41.305
Thanks for that.

35:42.640 --> 35:44.475
I told you I get worried if you get hurt.

35:45.184 --> 35:46.018
And I…

35:46.769 --> 35:48.688
thought you'd return home
if it kept hurting.

35:48.771 --> 35:50.523
I promise you I'll never go back there.

35:56.946 --> 36:00.283
I'm always going to stay
by your side at this distance.

36:14.714 --> 36:15.673
That's a promise.

36:25.183 --> 36:28.227
You are the one that
I'll be wearing for the rest of my life.

36:49.081 --> 36:50.082
Jang Uk.

36:52.335 --> 36:53.294
Let me explain.

36:54.712 --> 36:58.132
When I had woken up this morning,
I saw even more memories.

36:59.842 --> 37:01.719
Also vivid as if they were really mine.

37:04.764 --> 37:06.349
It was really overwhelming.

37:06.432 --> 37:07.266
And so what?

37:08.309 --> 37:11.020
Did you grab my hand to remind me
of something you knew I couldn't forget?

37:11.896 --> 37:13.231
So I could happily reminisce?

37:13.314 --> 37:15.358
Last night, you got to cry
as much as you'd like.

37:17.235 --> 37:18.486
Didn't you feel better…

37:20.321 --> 37:21.197
after you let it out?

37:22.782 --> 37:23.616
Yeah, I guess I did.

37:25.368 --> 37:26.619
Then I suppose…

37:27.620 --> 37:29.497
I've found yet another use
that you have for me.

37:31.666 --> 37:33.417
I can grab your hand or embrace you

37:33.960 --> 37:35.211
if I feel like I miss her.

37:35.795 --> 37:39.048
Or fall asleep with you in my arms so
I don't have to wait for her in my dreams.

37:40.466 --> 37:41.759
Since you're offering…

37:43.636 --> 37:44.887
to be her real-life substitute.

37:51.560 --> 37:53.104
Feel free to recreate another one.

37:54.480 --> 37:55.314
And this time,

37:56.774 --> 37:58.234
I promise I won't push you away again.

37:59.277 --> 38:00.111
Last night…

38:03.281 --> 38:04.615
I was trying to comfort you.

38:07.535 --> 38:08.995
Because you just seemed so sad.

38:13.374 --> 38:14.208
And today,

38:16.085 --> 38:17.253
I was trying to find out…

38:19.588 --> 38:21.173
if there was any room in there for me.

38:24.927 --> 38:26.470
It seems there isn't, so I'll just go.

38:43.362 --> 38:46.407
Did something bad happen
while you were at the palace?

38:48.492 --> 38:49.327
Nothing. No.

38:51.329 --> 38:53.205
Maidservant Kim, please give me your hand.

38:53.831 --> 38:55.124
- My hand?
- Mm.

38:55.207 --> 38:56.042
Here.

39:07.762 --> 39:09.638
And you are very precious as well.

39:09.722 --> 39:11.098
Oh, same here.

39:16.020 --> 39:18.064
Yeah, it should've felt more
like it did just now.

39:20.983 --> 39:22.401
But it felt so similar.

39:23.027 --> 39:23.861
What did?

39:24.904 --> 39:25.738
Oh, nothing.

39:27.782 --> 39:30.576
What did you say now
for her to cry like that?

39:30.659 --> 39:32.953
- She cried?
- No, but of course she was about to.

39:33.954 --> 39:35.581
What did you say this time to her?

39:35.664 --> 39:38.584
I don't know. I was just babbling
like a fool. She had surprised me, I--

39:38.667 --> 39:39.919
My goodness.

39:40.002 --> 39:42.254
I could put you over my knee
and spank you like a child.

39:42.338 --> 39:43.714
Here.

39:44.256 --> 39:47.468
Well, in any case,
at least you two are arguing

39:47.551 --> 39:49.220
and not just ignoring each other.

39:51.430 --> 39:54.392
But if you keep mistreating her this way,

39:54.475 --> 39:56.394
- you'll become a lost dog.
- Dog?

39:57.645 --> 39:59.897
Maidservant Kim,
did you call me a dog just now?

39:59.980 --> 40:01.399
Dear, did that hurt you?

40:01.482 --> 40:06.153
She's probably upset you thought
she's a chicken and not a pheasant, hmm.

40:06.237 --> 40:08.072
Can't deal with you two. Huh.

40:32.138 --> 40:33.722
Is it because of this jade?

40:54.034 --> 40:54.952
About what I said before,

40:56.704 --> 40:58.747
I didn't mean to imply
you were a chicken instead of a pheasant.

41:00.124 --> 41:02.626
It's not like I thought you were that,
but you were acting like one

41:02.710 --> 41:04.378
so that's the reason
why I lashed out at you.

41:07.923 --> 41:08.757
So please,

41:09.592 --> 41:10.926
don't ever act like a chicken.

41:12.136 --> 41:13.512
And I won't act like a dog either.

41:23.314 --> 41:24.857
So what did he say now?

41:24.940 --> 41:25.900
Did you reconcile?

41:25.983 --> 41:26.942
I don't really know.

41:27.526 --> 41:29.361
He said I was a chicken and he was a dog.

41:36.118 --> 41:39.330
Hey, was he joking or looking for a fight?

41:40.498 --> 41:41.582
I can't…

41:42.374 --> 41:44.960
Master Lee found
several of these sculptures

41:45.044 --> 41:47.379
at the bottoms of dried-up wells
in multiple villages.

41:47.463 --> 41:49.381
This is unspeakable sorcery.

41:49.465 --> 41:53.093
Someone has dried up the wells
intentionally out of pure hatred.

41:53.177 --> 41:57.681
The shamans sell things like these
at Gaema Village, don't they?

41:58.766 --> 41:59.934
It looks like a bird.

42:00.017 --> 42:01.685
The drought has yet to relent.

42:01.769 --> 42:04.396
So if all of the drinking wells dry up,
there will be unrest.

42:05.773 --> 42:10.069
It troubles me that
they were found in several wells now.

42:11.654 --> 42:13.948
Hey, Dang-gu,
use the merchants' association

42:14.031 --> 42:16.158
to find out if any other wells
in the capital have dried up.

42:16.951 --> 42:17.952
Yes.

42:18.577 --> 42:20.371
Shouldn't Master Lee be here with us?

42:20.454 --> 42:23.624
He went to see Jang Uk
to tell him about this thing.

42:23.707 --> 42:26.293
Then I'll go cook his favorite meal then.

42:27.044 --> 42:31.215
Spicy beef soup with lots of vegetables,
especially lots of brackens.

42:31.298 --> 42:32.299
- Don't you dare.
- No, you must not.

42:34.385 --> 42:37.137
Uh, he's probably staying at Jang Uk's
since he went to see him.

42:37.221 --> 42:40.224
Whether beef soup or something else,
Maidservant Kim will

42:40.307 --> 42:43.143
probably cook for him.
So don't cook anything for him, huh?

42:45.396 --> 42:46.855
That means Maidservant Kim

42:48.023 --> 42:49.441
will have to take…

42:50.568 --> 42:52.236
care of him?

42:52.319 --> 42:56.490
They got to be very close when he stayed
at Uk's place last time, isn't that right?

42:56.574 --> 43:00.953
Uh… he even, uh, stopped drinking

43:01.620 --> 43:04.665
chaste herb tea because of her.

43:04.748 --> 43:06.542
Is that so?

43:07.209 --> 43:10.129
Then does that mean that Master Lee…

43:10.212 --> 43:13.173
I guess I just know these things, right?

43:13.257 --> 43:15.926
He would even wear
this scarf around his neck

43:16.010 --> 43:18.387
that was a present given to him by her,

43:18.470 --> 43:20.389
even though the floors were heated.

43:21.390 --> 43:23.392
He kept wearing it despite how hot it got?

43:23.475 --> 43:25.311
That sounds like true love to me.

43:25.394 --> 43:26.895
Yeah.

43:31.609 --> 43:32.443
Uh, look.

43:32.985 --> 43:34.987
It was just a fleeting feeling

43:35.070 --> 43:37.531
he felt for a moment
of his very long life.

43:37.615 --> 43:39.408
Right, Jin, huh?

43:39.491 --> 43:40.534
True love!

43:41.285 --> 43:45.456
If it's his first time in his long life,
it's true, true, true love!

43:45.539 --> 43:46.915
Enough!

43:47.583 --> 43:48.959
Ah! True love?

43:54.548 --> 43:55.883
I will…

43:56.759 --> 43:58.844
make my beef soup anyways.

44:00.137 --> 44:01.639
So if I'm not feeding him…

44:03.140 --> 44:06.810
how about you two come and have some then?

44:07.936 --> 44:08.812
You too.

44:12.858 --> 44:14.652
- What?
- Oh, you! Are you kidding me?

44:15.152 --> 44:16.654
You!

44:27.790 --> 44:28.624
Who is it now?

44:39.134 --> 44:41.178
Jang Uk, it has been a long time.

44:41.261 --> 44:43.931
It's been far too long, Master Lee.

44:45.224 --> 44:48.686
Is there a tower here
for every time you killed a soul shifter?

44:50.187 --> 44:51.730
You've killed quite a few of them then.

44:51.814 --> 44:53.273
Why are you pretending
that you don't know?

44:53.357 --> 44:56.276
You're the one who's been pressuring
the Crown Prince to reward me

44:56.360 --> 44:57.236
for each and every one of them.

44:57.820 --> 44:59.196
Were you hurt that I met with him

44:59.780 --> 45:01.407
but I never took the time
to meet with you?

45:01.490 --> 45:03.575
Well, it's not like
I was really pining for you.

45:05.077 --> 45:07.413
But it's sure really nice
to see you here now.

45:10.290 --> 45:12.251
Is this one here her stone tower?

45:12.334 --> 45:13.919
You should have taken more care with it.

45:14.002 --> 45:16.004
It's built poorly compared to the others.

45:16.088 --> 45:17.423
I didn't build that one.

45:18.048 --> 45:19.383
Someone destroyed it.

45:20.175 --> 45:21.719
They tried to fix it
but now it looks like that.

45:21.802 --> 45:23.303
Who did? Park Jin?

45:23.387 --> 45:25.431
No, it was Jin Bu-yeon who did it.

45:26.807 --> 45:28.684
Jin Bu-yeon?
Bu-yeon was the one who destroyed it?

45:32.396 --> 45:33.605
Do you know Jin Bu-yeon?

45:35.232 --> 45:36.066
Yes.

45:37.526 --> 45:38.902
I'm the one who saved her life…

45:40.320 --> 45:41.572
and took care of her.

45:50.080 --> 45:52.624
Please don't remain
with Jang Uk any longer.

45:52.708 --> 45:55.085
Mother, I'm already married to Jang Uk.

45:56.253 --> 45:57.421
I won't be returning home.

45:59.882 --> 46:02.634
And why did he choose to marry you?

46:03.552 --> 46:05.971
Is it true that he's after Jinyowon?

46:06.054 --> 46:08.682
No, that's not true.
It's because he needs me.

46:10.768 --> 46:13.145
He's unable to sleep
because of the creatures that flock

46:13.854 --> 46:15.147
to the power of the ice stone.

46:15.898 --> 46:19.026
My divine powers are able
to drive those things away from him.

46:20.778 --> 46:25.324
Are you saying that
you've recovered powers like those?

46:26.658 --> 46:30.496
Yes. It seems like the physician
who treated me was right all along.

46:30.579 --> 46:34.041
I'm regaining my divine powers
as more of my memories return.

46:39.797 --> 46:43.133
Why aren't you asking me anything
after I told you I was her physician?

46:44.009 --> 46:46.512
She already told me all about it,
how she'd been ill,

46:47.054 --> 46:49.473
how she lost her memories,
and how she got locked up.

46:50.474 --> 46:53.894
But I had no idea that you were
the great physician who treated her.

46:55.145 --> 46:58.607
I agreed to keep it a secret
only because her mother begged me.

46:58.690 --> 47:01.777
So then you're telling me
you did absolutely nothing

47:01.860 --> 47:04.738
while she was locked up in a room
and had the tracking thread sewn in her?

47:04.822 --> 47:06.949
I'm sure her mother had
a reason for all of that.

47:07.825 --> 47:10.452
But you, of all people,
completely took the one thing

47:10.994 --> 47:12.913
she had tried so desperately to hide.

47:12.996 --> 47:14.331
Completely!

47:28.136 --> 47:29.096
Let's go back home.

47:29.179 --> 47:31.473
I promise that I will
let you do whatever you want.

47:31.557 --> 47:35.727
I won't lock you up or force you
to marry someone against your will.

47:36.478 --> 47:39.147
So there won't be any reason
for you to stay here

47:39.231 --> 47:40.566
and let him keep using you.

47:43.318 --> 47:44.570
I promised him that…

47:45.612 --> 47:46.864
I would stay by his side.

47:48.574 --> 47:49.741
So then I see…

47:51.451 --> 47:52.536
you're in love with him.

47:59.376 --> 48:00.335
You poor thing.

48:00.419 --> 48:03.130
It can be extremely painful
to long for someone who will…

48:04.131 --> 48:05.215
never love you back.

48:07.509 --> 48:08.719
End it here, Bu-yeon.

48:10.012 --> 48:10.846
But I don't…

48:11.889 --> 48:13.181
want to end it here with him.

48:15.100 --> 48:18.020
I got married to him
only because I wanted to.

48:19.396 --> 48:20.564
Really?

48:26.445 --> 48:27.905
In that case, very well then.

48:28.906 --> 48:31.575
Bring him over to Jinyowon sometime.

48:33.160 --> 48:34.870
- Why?
- It's the right thing to do

48:34.953 --> 48:36.455
as he's your husband after all.

48:36.538 --> 48:38.498
He should apologize for his actions

48:38.582 --> 48:41.001
and show that he wants to get along.

48:41.627 --> 48:43.378
I'll give him the chance to apologize

48:44.588 --> 48:45.422
so bring him over.

48:46.632 --> 48:50.218
He's not the type to apologize
or make demands from anyone.

48:50.302 --> 48:53.722
If you two insist on this marriage,
it's the least he could do.

48:56.850 --> 48:58.435
I'm giving him a chance…

48:59.561 --> 49:02.564
so be sure you come over together.

49:15.702 --> 49:17.663
He'd never go with her, right?

49:18.205 --> 49:19.748
I heard he never comes home.

49:19.831 --> 49:22.626
It's only natural for a man
to visit his in-laws.

49:23.502 --> 49:26.213
But I don't know
if he would ever say sorry.

49:28.173 --> 49:29.424
Young Master Park would have…

49:30.509 --> 49:32.552
gone happily if he got the chance.

49:39.810 --> 49:43.522
I believe this is made to imitate
the fire bird that's kept in Jinyowon.

49:44.189 --> 49:45.023
Fire bird?

49:46.108 --> 49:47.901
The bird they say was born in a volcano?

49:47.985 --> 49:52.114
Right. And the main reason why
Seo Gyeong and Jin Seol-ran

49:52.197 --> 49:55.075
made Jinyowon was to
lock up that bird forever.

49:55.158 --> 49:57.744
Why are you even telling me this then?

49:57.828 --> 50:00.706
Go to Jinyowon and check
if the fire bird is being kept safe.

50:00.789 --> 50:04.042
Only the members of the Jin family
can open the doors into Jinyowon.

50:04.126 --> 50:05.877
Your bride, Jin Bu-yeon could get in.

50:05.961 --> 50:07.462
Yes, but Bu-yeon was kicked out of there.

50:08.338 --> 50:10.882
Don't try to involve me
in things like this.

50:19.683 --> 50:22.436
How would you be able to
summon another ice stone though?

50:22.519 --> 50:25.105
I was told it's possible
by drying out the world.

50:31.361 --> 50:33.196
Even if I didn't force those two,

50:33.905 --> 50:36.742
they're already walking
the same destined path together.

50:40.370 --> 50:43.123
So Uk stays…

50:46.710 --> 50:47.794
Uk stays…

50:48.837 --> 50:51.173
in the room furthest
from the entrance in Jeongjingak.

50:52.049 --> 50:53.717
Although I don't know
if he's there right now.

50:54.885 --> 50:56.011
Should I tag along?

50:57.637 --> 51:00.265
No, thank you. We need to speak privately.

51:19.743 --> 51:22.329
Just say it, Bu-yeon,
like you practiced, okay?

51:29.795 --> 51:32.255
Oh! Ugh! Wait! Hold on.

51:32.839 --> 51:33.673
Don't open this.

51:34.633 --> 51:37.552
Just listen, okay? I have a favor I need.

51:43.683 --> 51:45.435
My mother wants us to go visit her.

51:46.436 --> 51:49.523
She wants you to apologize to her
and try to reconcile.

51:49.606 --> 51:52.609
Do that if you want to keep me
by your side since you need me.

51:54.694 --> 51:57.405
I get that you're rejecting me
after I tried to win your heart.

51:57.489 --> 52:00.158
So my pride also hurts
having to say this to you.

52:01.785 --> 52:02.911
I'll count to three.

52:03.787 --> 52:04.996
And open the door if you'll do it.

52:05.080 --> 52:06.456
If not, just stay there.

52:07.415 --> 52:08.416
And I'll just go away.

52:13.588 --> 52:14.422
So one.

52:16.758 --> 52:17.592
Two.

52:19.928 --> 52:20.762
Please!

52:32.065 --> 52:34.860
I'm sorry but I couldn't stop you
because you didn't give me a chance to.

52:35.443 --> 52:37.404
I didn't want you to
misunderstand anything

52:37.904 --> 52:39.114
so I had to come outside.

52:40.657 --> 52:42.367
I was told he was in the last room.

52:42.450 --> 52:45.787
Oh, Uk's room
is at the other end of this hallway, yeah.

52:47.414 --> 52:49.082
Took all my courage to say that.

52:50.959 --> 52:52.794
I guess I'll say it again.

52:55.172 --> 52:56.089
I'm sorry.

52:57.632 --> 52:58.508
He's not…

52:59.676 --> 53:01.052
He isn't in here at the moment.

53:01.636 --> 53:02.470
Ah.

53:05.015 --> 53:07.517
How do you think I sound?
Was it too desperate?

53:09.769 --> 53:10.604
Hmm…

53:12.480 --> 53:13.857
It didn't sound desperate.

53:14.566 --> 53:16.401
It sounded much more like a threat to me.

53:16.484 --> 53:17.319
A threat?

53:20.280 --> 53:22.032
I'll have to practice
my groveling a bit more.

53:22.115 --> 53:25.327
Why must you grovel to ask him
to go to your mother's house though?

53:25.410 --> 53:26.369
You're married, aren't you?

53:27.495 --> 53:31.166
We had agreed to turn
a blind eye to our foolishness.

53:31.249 --> 53:32.417
Pretend you heard nothing.

53:32.500 --> 53:34.628
How pathetic do you think I'll feel…

53:36.296 --> 53:37.464
when you ask me something like that?

53:59.611 --> 54:00.904
This is from Maidservant Kim.

54:00.987 --> 54:02.322
Said it's your favorite.

54:13.208 --> 54:14.417
Can't even say thank you.

54:15.502 --> 54:16.670
Making me beg.

54:18.922 --> 54:19.881
You wouldn't do that, would you?

54:20.632 --> 54:22.592
I bet you never apologized
for anything ever, either.

54:22.676 --> 54:23.510
What now?

54:24.094 --> 54:27.347
You always have some motive
when you say something unexpected.

54:28.848 --> 54:29.683
Listen.

54:31.142 --> 54:33.812
If you're not too busy today,
would you like to…

54:35.063 --> 54:36.898
go to Jinyowon with me?

54:36.982 --> 54:40.110
Is it because Master Lee asked you
to bring me with you to Jinyowon?

54:40.902 --> 54:41.736
What?

54:41.820 --> 54:43.697
I met the physician who had treated you.

54:43.780 --> 54:44.823
That was Master Lee.

54:44.906 --> 54:46.074
Do you know Master Lee as well?

54:46.157 --> 54:50.036
Yes. He told me
to go to Jinyowon with you.

54:50.120 --> 54:51.121
He told you to?

54:54.124 --> 54:55.542
Did Mother talk to him then?

54:55.625 --> 54:58.628
Does your mother want me
to come to Jinyowon as well?

54:58.712 --> 54:59.546
Yes.

55:00.839 --> 55:01.840
Would you come with me?

55:06.052 --> 55:07.721
No, I won't. I don't want to get involved.

55:09.055 --> 55:10.056
Jang Uk!

55:11.224 --> 55:13.560
If I were to grovel for you
a little bit more…

55:15.353 --> 55:16.354
would you come with me then?

55:16.438 --> 55:19.024
I already told Master Lee
that I wouldn't go there either.

55:20.358 --> 55:22.527
So there's no need
for you to keep begging me.

55:26.573 --> 55:27.407
Fine.

55:28.533 --> 55:30.327
I was just trying to stay by your side.

55:32.329 --> 55:33.330
Forget it.

55:34.164 --> 55:35.081
I'll just go.

56:00.648 --> 56:03.360
Do that if you want to keep me
by your side, since you need me.

56:05.487 --> 56:08.156
I get that you're rejecting me
after I tried to win your heart.

56:08.740 --> 56:11.409
So my pride also hurts
having to say this to you.

56:32.138 --> 56:32.972
Why would…

56:33.973 --> 56:36.684
she get that upset about me
not going to Jinyowon with her?

56:36.768 --> 56:38.770
Master Lee's the one who should be upset.

56:53.868 --> 56:56.162
Where's Bu-yeon? Did she come home?

56:56.246 --> 56:59.541
She was here for a while,
but she left for Jinyowon.

56:59.624 --> 57:02.377
- Alone?
- She said that you wouldn't go with her.

57:02.460 --> 57:06.423
Even though I offered to go instead,
she declined and went there by herself.

57:06.506 --> 57:08.133
Why would you even offer to go with her?

57:08.216 --> 57:10.009
Just think of how embarrassed
she must have been!

57:10.093 --> 57:11.761
Her mother came all the way here

57:11.845 --> 57:14.889
and invited the two of you over,
offering to forgive it all.

57:14.973 --> 57:17.767
But you just…
you just rejected her right away.

57:18.643 --> 57:21.146
- What?
- I sent her off with so many presents.

57:21.229 --> 57:24.566
But the reality is
she may never even return this time.

57:24.649 --> 57:26.276
Lady Jin told her that she would

57:26.359 --> 57:28.278
set her free
if she denounced the marriage.

57:29.320 --> 57:30.488
I can't…

57:36.077 --> 57:39.747
You chose to come here alone
to see me? Why would you?

57:39.831 --> 57:42.709
It seems as though you mistook the owner
of the eye mask I gave to you.

57:42.792 --> 57:44.419
So I came here to correct your mistake.

57:44.502 --> 57:46.796
In return, I'd like to ask you a favor.

57:46.880 --> 57:49.799
I know you are well aware
that I could kill you for coming here.

57:50.842 --> 57:52.051
But you're here for a favor?

57:53.511 --> 57:55.555
- Let me hear it.
- Before Lord Jin had me

57:55.638 --> 57:58.933
pretend to be your daughter,
he put a blood parasite inside of my body.

57:59.934 --> 58:00.935
Parasite?

58:01.019 --> 58:05.023
So that's how you used to have
the energy of the Jin family within you.

58:05.106 --> 58:07.150
It's settled into the core
of my energy now.

58:08.401 --> 58:09.903
So please tell me how to get rid of it.

58:09.986 --> 58:12.697
How is it possible?
You can't cast spells, can you?

58:13.490 --> 58:14.699
Because if that's the case,

58:14.782 --> 58:17.202
you can't remove it,
at least not before you die.

58:17.285 --> 58:19.621
Lady Jin, please actively
look for a way to do so.

58:20.288 --> 58:22.665
As Jinyowon's leader,
I know you can do anything.

58:22.749 --> 58:23.708
In return,

58:24.542 --> 58:26.419
I promise I'll tell you who…

58:27.462 --> 58:28.588
the real Bu-yeon is.

58:30.548 --> 58:31.424
There's no need.

58:32.091 --> 58:33.593
I've already found my daughter.

58:33.676 --> 58:34.511
Wrong!

58:35.595 --> 58:37.597
That eye mask definitely
belonged to someone else.

58:37.680 --> 58:38.973
Shut your mouth!

58:40.975 --> 58:43.478
Lady Jin. Young Lady Jin has arrived.

58:43.561 --> 58:45.063
- She's here?
- That's perfect!

58:45.688 --> 58:47.732
I can prove that
it's not Bu-yeon before you.

58:51.486 --> 58:53.530
Lock her up in the annex for now.

58:54.489 --> 58:55.490
Yes.

59:06.292 --> 59:07.794
These are gifts from the Jang family.

59:21.432 --> 59:22.600
So she came here alone.

59:30.441 --> 59:31.693
Mother, I came here to see you.

59:33.611 --> 59:34.821
I came here as well.

59:50.336 --> 59:52.130
Thank you for inviting the two of us over.

59:53.089 --> 59:55.049
I'm sorry I've been acting so rude to you

59:55.633 --> 59:56.759
all this time.

59:56.843 --> 59:58.845
I hope we get along
from this moment forward.

01:00:07.270 --> 01:00:09.564
Well, Mother. We came to see you together.

01:00:14.819 --> 01:00:16.946
My grandfather asked me
to bring Master Lee

01:00:17.030 --> 01:00:18.823
to Sejukwon if he's here with you.

01:00:18.906 --> 01:00:20.742
Master Lee has returned to Songrim?

01:00:21.618 --> 01:00:23.119
But he hasn't been by the house yet.

01:00:23.202 --> 01:00:25.622
He was supposed
to visit Young Master Jang.

01:00:25.705 --> 01:00:26.539
Ah.

01:00:27.081 --> 01:00:30.793
Our Young Master has gone
with Young Lady Jin over to Jinyowon

01:00:30.877 --> 01:00:32.587
to pay his respects to her mother.

01:00:32.670 --> 01:00:33.546
Oh.

01:00:34.631 --> 01:00:35.465
Is that so?

01:00:36.132 --> 01:00:38.885
I'll make sure to take care
of Master Lee if he comes by.

01:00:38.968 --> 01:00:41.220
No, you can't.
We were told to bring him with us

01:00:41.304 --> 01:00:43.139
as Lord Park needs
to be rescued by Master Lee.

01:00:43.222 --> 01:00:44.974
What happened? Has Lord Park fallen ill?

01:00:45.975 --> 01:00:49.145
Quite ill, in fact,
his spicy beef soup is really good.

01:00:50.396 --> 01:00:51.981
His beef soup tastes good?

01:00:52.982 --> 01:00:54.108
Oh!

01:00:59.656 --> 01:01:00.698
Hmm.

01:01:01.699 --> 01:01:02.533
This is…

01:01:03.618 --> 01:01:04.661
quite tasty.

01:01:11.751 --> 01:01:12.669
Hello, my lord.

01:01:13.419 --> 01:01:14.754
Are you okay in there?

01:01:16.172 --> 01:01:18.341
I have these terrible knots in my stomach.

01:01:19.550 --> 01:01:22.804
I think that I may have indigestion.

01:01:22.887 --> 01:01:24.847
Perhaps we better take you to Sejukwon.

01:01:24.931 --> 01:01:26.307
It's not that bad though.

01:01:27.350 --> 01:01:28.685
But, Maidservant Kim,

01:01:29.519 --> 01:01:31.688
shouldn't you be tending to…

01:01:33.022 --> 01:01:34.482
Master Lee right this moment?

01:01:37.652 --> 01:01:38.486
I mean…

01:01:39.028 --> 01:01:42.782
why would I be tending to him
when you're feeling this ill, my lord?

01:01:42.865 --> 01:01:44.951
I'm certain
he's getting on fine without me.

01:01:45.493 --> 01:01:46.327
Is that so?

01:01:46.411 --> 01:01:48.871
Is there anywhere else
that's bothering you?

01:01:49.455 --> 01:01:51.708
I think I have a headache as well.

01:01:51.791 --> 01:01:53.418
- Oh, goodness. Is that so?
- Mm-hmm.

01:01:53.501 --> 01:01:56.462
Let's see. Let's see.
Oh, I think you've even got a fever.

01:01:56.546 --> 01:01:59.048
- Yeah, sure.
- Should I get a cold towel for you?

01:02:02.009 --> 01:02:03.720
But you're probably so busy.

01:02:04.887 --> 01:02:07.265
Are you certain you can stay with me?

01:02:07.348 --> 01:02:09.517
But how can I leave when you're sick?

01:02:09.600 --> 01:02:11.728
I'm staying with you.

01:02:12.270 --> 01:02:13.396
Thank you so much.

01:02:14.564 --> 01:02:16.023
- Oh. Ow, my stomach.
- Oh, no!

01:02:16.107 --> 01:02:18.401
Oh, no, my lord! Does your tummy hurt?

01:02:23.030 --> 01:02:24.532
Don't do anything foolish.

01:02:28.494 --> 01:02:30.163
He was causing a scene at the entrance

01:02:30.246 --> 01:02:33.499
and was demanding to speak with you,
so I brought him.

01:02:33.583 --> 01:02:34.459
So what's wrong?

01:02:34.542 --> 01:02:36.294
Please come with me and save our madam.

01:02:36.961 --> 01:02:39.130
She's going to die now all because of you.

01:02:46.304 --> 01:02:49.557
So you're saying
So-i went to Jinyowon to see Lady Jin?

01:02:50.475 --> 01:02:52.810
She left earlier today
but hasn't come back.

01:02:54.437 --> 01:02:57.106
She told me to relay this
if something happened,

01:02:57.607 --> 01:02:58.816
if it seemed like she was in trouble.

01:03:00.067 --> 01:03:01.819
"Lady Jin's real daughter, in fact,

01:03:01.903 --> 01:03:04.697
…was the blind girl
who lived in Sari Village with me."

01:03:05.573 --> 01:03:06.407
Tell him that.

01:03:08.326 --> 01:03:10.203
If I die in Jinyowon, tell him to

01:03:10.870 --> 01:03:13.456
threaten her with my dead body
and that secret

01:03:13.539 --> 01:03:15.458
so he can find some way to stay alive.

01:03:18.044 --> 01:03:19.504
He has to live no matter what.

01:03:25.885 --> 01:03:27.512
The blind girl from Sari Village.

01:03:29.138 --> 01:03:30.389
Is that really what she said?

01:03:34.101 --> 01:03:36.813
That girl was
Jin Ho-gyeong's daughter?

01:03:38.105 --> 01:03:40.566
I… I don't know what
she's talking about, but please…

01:03:42.527 --> 01:03:44.445
please help us save our madam.

01:03:46.614 --> 01:03:48.783
How long has it been
since So-i entered Jinyowon?

01:04:16.811 --> 01:04:19.814
The Queen has told me
to trust you and let you help our cause.

01:04:21.148 --> 01:04:23.860
So I'll let you be
a part of the task at hand.

01:04:23.943 --> 01:04:26.404
I'll do my best, my lord,
whatever it may be.

01:04:35.913 --> 01:04:39.750
These are earthenwares,
made from the southern volcano

01:04:39.834 --> 01:04:41.544
and sculpted into a bird.

01:04:41.627 --> 01:04:45.006
A bird born from a volcano?
Are you referring to the fire bird?

01:04:49.969 --> 01:04:52.221
A boat carrying
these precious earthenwares

01:04:52.305 --> 01:04:53.264
must enter here.

01:04:53.764 --> 01:04:56.309
But it won't be easy
without Songrim noticing.

01:04:57.351 --> 01:05:01.647
Use the Seo family's connections
to bring them in safe and sound.

01:05:02.523 --> 01:05:04.692
How hard could it be
bringing in a single boat?

01:05:05.359 --> 01:05:06.402
You can count on me.

01:05:11.866 --> 01:05:13.200
Uncle, are you in there?

01:05:13.284 --> 01:05:14.911
I've come to inform you
of something urgent.

01:05:17.622 --> 01:05:18.623
Uncle.

01:05:19.290 --> 01:05:21.375
Lord Park! Please come out, my lord.

01:05:23.544 --> 01:05:26.547
My lord. Please, my lord. My lord!

01:05:27.423 --> 01:05:28.549
Shh!

01:05:28.633 --> 01:05:30.635
- What's wrong?
- I think there's someone outside.

01:05:30.718 --> 01:05:32.511
Huh? Who?

01:05:33.804 --> 01:05:34.972
Who's there? Oh, goodness.

01:05:43.522 --> 01:05:44.523
There's a lot out there.

01:05:44.607 --> 01:05:46.233
What could it be?

01:05:46.317 --> 01:05:48.694
No, wait!

01:05:49.362 --> 01:05:51.280
I'm here! What about me though?

01:05:51.364 --> 01:05:53.824
What would they think if they saw me here,

01:05:53.908 --> 01:05:55.534
this late at night with you?

01:05:57.995 --> 01:06:01.165
Oh, no! What do we do?
What do we do? Oh, no!

01:06:07.088 --> 01:06:09.006
Uncle, I'm coming in now.

01:06:10.174 --> 01:06:11.384
What?

01:06:12.343 --> 01:06:13.344
What's wrong?

01:06:16.847 --> 01:06:17.890
Oh.

01:06:19.308 --> 01:06:22.019
Never mind, we'll go back
for now, my lord.

01:06:24.563 --> 01:06:25.398
Let's go!

01:06:28.442 --> 01:06:30.528
Oh, no! They know!

01:06:31.946 --> 01:06:33.280
They must have caught on.

01:06:33.364 --> 01:06:35.741
Maybe we should've just
gone out and greeted them.

01:06:36.492 --> 01:06:38.619
What do I do? I'm so embarrassed.

01:06:39.870 --> 01:06:41.414
How can you be laughing

01:06:41.497 --> 01:06:42.415
in this situation?

01:06:42.999 --> 01:06:44.083
You're just so pretty.

01:06:44.166 --> 01:06:48.045
Your shyness right now reminds me
of an adolescent girl.

01:06:49.255 --> 01:06:50.089
Oh.

01:06:51.298 --> 01:06:53.342
Thanks to you, I also feel like

01:06:53.426 --> 01:06:58.472
an adolescent boy who's been caught
sneaking around with his date.

01:07:00.850 --> 01:07:02.601
It's really nice to hear that you feel…

01:07:03.894 --> 01:07:04.812
youthful around me.

01:07:06.564 --> 01:07:07.398
Let us…

01:07:09.108 --> 01:07:11.360
spend our lives together.

01:07:27.251 --> 01:07:28.794
I, Park Jin of Songrim,

01:07:29.712 --> 01:07:31.714
ask Kim Yeon from Wol Fortress,

01:07:33.174 --> 01:07:37.303
to please take my hand in marriage.

01:07:42.767 --> 01:07:43.601
I,

01:07:44.852 --> 01:07:46.187
Kim Yeon of Wol Fortress,

01:07:48.355 --> 01:07:49.982
accept Park Jin of Songrim's…

01:07:51.567 --> 01:07:52.943
proposal to marry me.

01:07:57.907 --> 01:08:00.159
Lord Park! Congratulations!

01:08:00.242 --> 01:08:01.911
Congratulations!

01:08:02.912 --> 01:08:04.455
I guess they never left.

01:08:04.538 --> 01:08:06.582
I guess they did not go.

01:08:06.665 --> 01:08:10.503
Congratulations! Congrats!

01:08:10.586 --> 01:08:12.171
I never thought this would happen!

01:08:12.254 --> 01:08:14.548
- Congrats you two!
- Congratulations!

01:08:15.633 --> 01:08:17.802
Congratulations!

01:08:19.845 --> 01:08:20.679
Oh, my…

01:08:40.908 --> 01:08:43.077
Thank you for welcoming us with open arms

01:08:43.160 --> 01:08:44.745
even though you weren't
happy with our union.

01:08:44.829 --> 01:08:46.914
Well, I did invite you here after all.

01:08:48.124 --> 01:08:49.375
- All right, then.
- All right, then…

01:08:50.668 --> 01:08:52.253
Lady Jin, would you please
show us to our room?

01:08:54.755 --> 01:08:57.716
You want to spend
the night here in Jinyowon?

01:08:58.384 --> 01:09:00.678
This is our first time visiting
since getting married,

01:09:00.761 --> 01:09:02.388
so it's important
that we fulfill our duties.

01:09:02.471 --> 01:09:05.266
If we return now, I'll get
an earful from Maidservant Kim.

01:09:05.850 --> 01:09:09.270
That's true. It's only right
that you two spend the night.

01:09:11.438 --> 01:09:14.608
But I haven't prepared a room
for you both to stay in tonight.

01:09:14.692 --> 01:09:17.153
As we're here to fulfill our duties,
it doesn't matter where we stay.

01:09:17.236 --> 01:09:20.489
We'd happily take
even that room she was locked in.

01:09:20.573 --> 01:09:21.699
We'll spend the night in there.

01:09:22.575 --> 01:09:24.368
Oh, not there. How can I let you?

01:09:24.451 --> 01:09:27.329
I will quickly prepare
a room for you both.

01:09:27.955 --> 01:09:29.415
Would you for us?

01:09:29.498 --> 01:09:31.709
Although it shouldn't be too hard…

01:09:32.585 --> 01:09:33.961
in this spacious abode.

01:09:59.945 --> 01:10:01.906
I'm grateful that you came with.

01:10:04.033 --> 01:10:05.784
But there was no need
for us to stay the night.

01:10:07.494 --> 01:10:08.329
We do.

01:10:09.038 --> 01:10:10.623
That is part of the reason
why I came here.

01:10:12.041 --> 01:10:13.751
You want us to spend
our first night together here?

01:10:15.211 --> 01:10:17.213
All I said is that I wanted
to spend the night here.

01:10:17.963 --> 01:10:19.548
Why would you think
we're doing it tonight?

01:10:20.758 --> 01:10:21.634
How could I not?

01:10:21.717 --> 01:10:23.219
It's supposed to be
our first married visit.

01:10:23.302 --> 01:10:25.387
There's alcohol and
a newlyweds' bed here too.

01:10:26.096 --> 01:10:27.514
It's only natural for me to assume

01:10:27.598 --> 01:10:29.099
you're here to spend
our first night together.

01:10:29.183 --> 01:10:32.978
I'm sorry if I disappointed you,
but I have something I need to do first.

01:10:33.687 --> 01:10:35.272
Master Lee asked me for a favor.

01:10:37.191 --> 01:10:40.069
For what? That you would
come to Jinyowon with me?

01:10:41.403 --> 01:10:42.238
Yes.

01:10:42.321 --> 01:10:44.615
Earlier, we seemed to have
misunderstood each other.

01:10:45.407 --> 01:10:47.201
I've done everything you've asked for.

01:10:47.284 --> 01:10:50.412
Now, we must go do what I need to do.

01:10:51.080 --> 01:10:51.914
What's that?

01:10:53.791 --> 01:10:57.044
Tonight, I'm gonna need you to
open the door to Jinyowon for me.

01:10:58.212 --> 01:11:00.005
What is it
that you seek from Jinyowon?

01:11:00.923 --> 01:11:03.008
If it's an artifact
for the rite of the lake,

01:11:03.092 --> 01:11:05.469
you should be able to
formally request it from Lady Jin.

01:11:05.552 --> 01:11:06.512
That item…

01:11:07.763 --> 01:11:09.974
is something not even Lady Jin can touch.

01:11:10.641 --> 01:11:13.560
Jinyowon will crumble
if it is taken out of there.

01:11:13.644 --> 01:11:15.020
Jin Mu, are you after…

01:11:16.981 --> 01:11:18.065
the great fire bird by chance?

01:11:20.192 --> 01:11:21.026
That's right.

01:11:22.403 --> 01:11:25.197
It's something that can
only be gained by ruling Jinyowon.

01:11:25.281 --> 01:11:27.866
So the lake rite that
Cheonbugwan has been preparing for…

01:11:28.951 --> 01:11:31.203
was not actually the rain
like I thought before.

01:11:33.622 --> 01:11:35.374
Are you looking for the ice stone again?

01:11:36.041 --> 01:11:40.546
Had I not agreed to share
all my powers with you, Your Highness?

01:11:40.629 --> 01:11:42.965
- That agreement ended three years ago.
- No, it didn't.

01:11:43.048 --> 01:11:45.759
And you could have killed me
and put an end to all of this.

01:11:45.843 --> 01:11:48.345
You spared me. So from then on…

01:11:49.930 --> 01:11:53.851
you and I have always been
working together, so when did it end?

01:11:53.934 --> 01:11:54.893
If that's the case…

01:11:58.397 --> 01:11:59.440
let me end it right now.

01:12:02.860 --> 01:12:04.028
You must also stop this.

01:12:04.111 --> 01:12:05.946
If you truly wish for me to stop,

01:12:06.030 --> 01:12:08.907
just go to Jang Uk
and tell him the truth about everything.

01:12:08.991 --> 01:12:12.911
"Jang Uk, I manipulated and killed Naksu
in order for me to beat you."

01:12:12.995 --> 01:12:16.373
And I, Jin Mu,
did that solely for you, Sire.

01:12:18.792 --> 01:12:21.795
If you can't tell Jang Uk the truth
about the nature of your actions…

01:12:23.630 --> 01:12:25.215
you won't end this.

01:12:47.654 --> 01:12:49.114
I had no idea…

01:12:50.282 --> 01:12:52.659
that you already knew
who your real daughter was.

01:12:55.162 --> 01:12:57.539
And that she's been alive by your side.

01:12:58.499 --> 01:13:01.627
Who else knows the truth
about my daughter? Give me their names.

01:13:03.837 --> 01:13:04.797
Answer me.

01:13:06.715 --> 01:13:07.841
Does Jin Mu know?

01:13:08.759 --> 01:13:09.718
Someone from Songrim?

01:13:15.265 --> 01:13:18.185
If you're so curious,
go and ask them yourself.

01:13:18.268 --> 01:13:20.813
Ask them if they know that Jin Bu-yeon

01:13:20.896 --> 01:13:23.649
that you fished
out of Lake Gyeongcheondaeho…

01:13:25.734 --> 01:13:27.194
was actually…

01:13:28.654 --> 01:13:29.488
Naksu.

01:13:42.835 --> 01:13:43.669
Hey.

01:13:44.294 --> 01:13:45.963
You can open the doors, can't you?

01:13:46.046 --> 01:13:47.339
Of course I can.

01:13:48.006 --> 01:13:51.009
That was the first thing that
my mother asked me to do when I woke up.

01:13:52.553 --> 01:13:53.387
But, uh…

01:13:54.471 --> 01:13:55.597
what do you need to do in there?

01:13:57.015 --> 01:13:59.643
I just need to see if the object
Master Lee mentioned is still in there.

01:14:00.227 --> 01:14:02.646
Don't worry, I'm not trying
to use you to help me steal anything.

01:14:21.874 --> 01:14:23.208
People were walking by.

01:14:24.376 --> 01:14:26.712
I wasn't making a move. Don't worry.

01:14:26.795 --> 01:14:28.130
We are guests here.

01:14:28.630 --> 01:14:30.883
All we have to do is say
we're taking a walk.

01:14:30.966 --> 01:14:31.800
Oh.

01:14:32.926 --> 01:14:33.760
You're right.

01:14:36.430 --> 01:14:38.432
It's my habit to hide.

01:14:40.809 --> 01:14:43.437
Were you not allowed to even walk
through the gardens

01:14:43.520 --> 01:14:45.689
- when you were locked up?
- No.

01:14:47.441 --> 01:14:48.901
I really felt like I was…

01:14:49.776 --> 01:14:51.195
suffocating in that room.

01:14:52.404 --> 01:14:55.824
I often imagined myself standing alone
on top of a very tall tree.

01:14:56.825 --> 01:15:00.454
I knew no one
and I felt so helpless with no one around.

01:15:02.873 --> 01:15:04.666
I was hoping
someone would come and rescue me.

01:15:07.211 --> 01:15:08.295
And then you came.

01:15:12.049 --> 01:15:12.883
What?

01:15:15.010 --> 01:15:16.261
What are you talking about?

01:15:18.889 --> 01:15:20.891
It's just my fantasy.

01:15:22.935 --> 01:15:25.646
I told you there was something
I kept thinking about in that room.

01:15:26.772 --> 01:15:28.857
I promise you I don't have that stone!

01:16:06.937 --> 01:16:07.938
I must have…

01:16:10.774 --> 01:16:12.109
gone crazy because of you.

01:17:04.745 --> 01:17:07.664
ALCHEMY OF SOULS
PART 2

01:17:08.165 --> 01:17:10.083
Someone just entered from over there.

01:17:10.167 --> 01:17:12.085
So-i, So-i, do you recognize me?

01:17:12.169 --> 01:17:15.005
Why do you say that?
Has your husband not come back yet?

01:17:15.088 --> 01:17:17.299
Leaving you alone like that
means it's over.

01:17:17.382 --> 01:17:18.258
Not now.

01:17:18.342 --> 01:17:19.217
I'm also going to stay.

01:17:20.260 --> 01:17:22.387
I plan to find my own room

01:17:22.471 --> 01:17:25.474
so that you don't get confused anymore.

01:17:25.557 --> 01:17:27.559
Because if you're right,
it means all my pain

01:17:27.643 --> 01:17:29.227
is because I kept this.

01:17:31.313 --> 01:17:34.900
So So-i's parasite
is inside Seo Yul's body.
